Solution

Ingress

What is Ingress?

Ingress provides a single entry point into the cluster.

Your Ecommerce Ingress
rules:

  - path: /
    backend:
      service:
        name: ecommers-frontend-service

  - path: /api
    backend:
      service:
        name: ecommerce-backend-service
